{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右百八十有六字，為「唐勅賜心鏡禪師真身舍利塔」文字中之尚可辨者。句文斷蝕，不可卒讀。原文尚無旁本發\n見，可資校證。爰付影寫，以存其真。何日得窺全豹，俟諸來者。寥士記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原刻字樣，大小不等。共剝蝕若干字，亦不敢臆斷。右所謄錄者，略存原形而已。寥士又記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十頁十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十頁二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十頁二十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輿地碑目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十六頁三十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓瑛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓瑛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十八頁十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案《敬止錄》云：「景求初貫蘇州，曾任明州判，遂家於鄞，治第甬東。後徙豐樂鄉東\n山下，遂捨甬東居宅為寺。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《天童寺志．卷三．心鏡奐禪師傳》略同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《天童寺志．卷三．心鏡奐禪師傳》略同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《寶慶志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十六頁三十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案《明州雜謠注》，洪武十九年，信\n國公湯和起，遣海島居民遷入江東，奏改棲心寺為補陀寺。與《成化志》差一年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷二頁二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十八頁十\n三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《敬止錄》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷六十六頁三十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康熙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒二十一年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《鄞縣志》卷六十八頁十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上《鄞縣志．卷六十八》引《成化\n志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《鄞縣志．卷六十》引《嘉靖志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上《鄞縣志．卷六十六》引《朱志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上採訪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康熙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《鄞縣志．卷六十六》引《聞志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙未歲長至\n月，鎮海陳修榆敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙未長至月，鎮悔陳修榆敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上皆匾額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙卯中秋，慈運私淑弟子吳嘉瑞敬撰並書。\n\n信士陳裘賡，率男亦銓、亦山，孫本初、本崇、本祥敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國九年，歲次庚申，十月穀旦，里人謝行溎撰。蔡和鏘謹書。護法\n信士柳哲衲，率男中炤、孫和堯敬獻助。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國八年九月夏，同龢薰沐敬書。信士余葆三，率男學樑、學楨、學棟、學楣、學柟敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒廿三年春王月吉旦，\n弟子董茂容，率男仁卿敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒十九年六月穀旦，里人李瑞彰敬立，命子仲光沐手謹書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十三年，歲在閼逢閹茂，南呂月中澣穀旦，賞穿黃馬褂花翎，強勇達春巴圖魯提督，浙江全省水陸軍務節制各鎮加一級，黃少\n春敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治四年，歲在乙丑，無射月全澣吉旦，邑人陳勵敬書。弟子張朝宗，率男道業、道榆、道榮、道枋、道林，孫克廣、克鎮、克賢、克昌、克配敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒元年，歲次乙亥，孟秋月上澣穀旦，里人陳懋采敬書。廈門幫通泉號、元昌號、啟興號同敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十二年癸酉歲，黃鐘月穀旦，里人孫學庭謹書。寧幫眾米商公立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十三年，歲次甲戌，七月穀旦，陳愈涌敬書。甬上北號眾商敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒丙子歲，林鎰月、甬江木號眾商敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒廿一年乙未，二月穀旦，部下弟子陳祖浩，率男烈鈁、烈銘、烈欽，孫愈桐、愈梓敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒五年，歲在乙卯，春正月，會稽王繼香撰。里人陳允升書。里人吳煊，率男顯鋆、顯厘、顯珪，孫家樑、家楨、家楣敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十二年，昭陽作噩之歲，良月吉旦，邑人張慶璜題。\n\n泉州深滬幫謙泰號商敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壬申仲秋立，元和顧文彬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "己未冬月，常住重修眾姓女敬獻。夏汝霖敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒仲冬月穀旦，補用同知候補知縣錢鍾麟敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十一年孟秋之月，重修七塔寺告成，謹撰楹聯題於柱石。布政使銜甯紹\n台海防兵備道，顧文彬敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十一年九月中浣，\n里人童華薰沐謹書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鐵峯張恕敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十二年，歲次癸酉，嘉平月穀旦，里人趙佑宸敬撰。廖祖憲敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十有一年，九秋之吉，\n谿上張廣延書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十三年長至月，甬上凌忠鎮撰句并篆。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十年辛未歲，八月全\n浣，里人章鋆敬撰并書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十年，十月上浣，里人\n周岱敬撰并書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治甲戌，仲夏穀旦，張家驤敬題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治甲戌，小春月榖旦，陸廷黻敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治\n十有三年，歲次甲戌，杪冬之吉，弟子周晉麒敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同治十有三年，歲次甲戌，六月之吉，長沙彭慰高撰句敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敝寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壬子冬月景辰，長沙蕭榮爵書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒二十九年，一陽月吉立，邑人周振翰敬書。張門顧氏善蓮敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒丁酉歲，嘉平月吉旦，里人王振鈺謹書。甬三境弟子屠益哉、王明遠、張維新敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國廿五年十月，重修殿宇，三聖裝金開光。溥常述句，東光陳寶麟書，張崇黼敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒辛卯，仲春月穀旦，里人陳烈鏞謹撰並書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "里人林鼎梅撰并書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "里人張世訓撰并書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "里人徐隆圻謹撰并書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒甲午年，孟\n秋穀旦，弟子李庭芳，率男名煊、名炯，孫廣善、廣書敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十四年仲冬月，皈依童男圓吉、徐孟楣，\n隨喜住持溥常撰句。金峨七十老樵卓梵敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國廿五年秋月，信女朱門馮氏式慧敬助。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方丈屬瀾撰書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敝寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敝寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丙子春，住持溥常立，鄮西范文虎書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈運大和尚法鑒，叔平翁同龢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十五年春月，林森。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒柔兆敦牂陽月，為八十壽僧慈運長老傳戒頌，浙東觀察使者喻兆蕃題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒三十二年，歲次丙午，孟冬月穀旦，賜進士出身、翰林院編修加三級，族姪朱卓英頓首書，為慈運老和尚八旬開慶志喜。法\n\n晚：寄禪、因靜、淡雲、正明、真常、妙見、悟真、好心、超有、道階頂禮同祝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒三十二年，歲次丙午，陽月上浣良辰，蛟川董思曾書，恭祝本師慈運老和尚上壽。嗣法人：宏教、宏緒、宏演、宏訓、宏蓮、宏晉、宏綱、\n宏明、宏淨、宏成、宏信、宏法、宏修、宏壽、宏權、宏化、宏道、宏聖、宏滿、宏覺、宏一、宏燦、宏楊、宏達、宏瑞、宏深、宏引、宏得、宏海、宏圓同頂祝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國十四年十二月，縣人陳磬裁識，童第錦書。常西法師與余交廿年，未嘗見其有喜慍之色，蓋其得於道者深矣。爰書四言遺之，以志\n景仰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓瑛大和尚主席天童寺，禪定育王寺。源龍暨兩序恭賀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺圓大禪師慈鑒。天台山農書，弟子楊蓮生、常春恆和南敬獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丙子仲秋，漢陽關炯敬題。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈運老和尚淨德千古。壬子冬，蕭榮爵敬書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國廿五年，戴傳賢書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒戊申歲吉立，蛟川胡元欽、胡和卿敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國戊辰年吉立，鎮海陳修榆書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒三十有四年仲春，遊七塔寺，見高僧慈運長老，暨令法徒自真方丈大和尚，領眾行道，大有古德高風。因留四字，以為後進欽頌云。\n仁和高邕書并跋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國十二年四月穀旦，安化陶思曾題，本寺住持弘一敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國丙寅年春三月，覺圓方丈和尚法鑒。弟子王紫光敬贈，邗江顏湘泉書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "岐昌法兄大和尚六旬志慶，長沙蕭榮爵拜書。癸丑陽月，法弟：友法、果如、僧晉、蓮生、賢兆、蓬萊、自真、智圓、常西、圓瑛、道階同祝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中華民國二十三年冬月吉立。溥常大和尚宏揚戒法，圓瑛敬書。法晚：本舟、式堂、德軒、勵深、大智、明校、寬明、鉅鏞、錦堂、可亮、寶泉、法\n舟、寶池、見雲、惺悟、清奇、勛明、空觀、常慧、自空、瑞岩、竹林、果成、妙潔、懷遠、玉亮、嘉善、攸久、慈航、苾法、月定、指南、密庵、明性、樂天、圓明、空印、法源、善智、能安、靜\n明、法悟、新山、同榮、得一、嵩庭、妙勝、大亮、妙安、智根、哲明、寶成、常空、瑞蓮、普周、性源、雲谷、常學、華光、蓮度、明峯、梵雲、碧林同敬賀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸亥春月穀旦，孫嘯洲書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國九年五月日，二等大綬、三等寶光嘉禾章、四等文虎章，調署會稽道尹黃慶瀾敬立。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國十一年十月穀旦，浙海關監督袁思永獻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溥常法師弘演《華嚴》於七塔寺者有年，今主持報恩、長佛學院，乃為題此以留紀念。乙亥初夏，雪山太虛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報恩堂上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佑琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指南謹注"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寧波佛教孤兒院、福建泉州開元慈兒院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重興鄞縣接待寺，閩開元寺、法海寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳鈞　王建三　辜耀德　陳伯臣　章銜青　丁則餘　許道生　陳錸　歐陽軫　蔡維符"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在位八天圓寂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上均代理住持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四月上任"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冬月改就天童寺方丈，選舉本舟繼任"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（卓柱云）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬安"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬安"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬安"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（擲杖下座）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（卓拄杖云）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（卓拄杖云）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（卓拄\n杖云）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國廿四年十二月十五晚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（卓香板云）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十二年古曆十一月十七日進院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（下座）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十月十四日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（下座）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十月十五日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二月廿一日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正月十五日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十五年十二月十四日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附客堂同事規約"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附募化序文、助捐鴻名、禪堂基金息用細則、公議禪堂坐香紀事錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附逐日細則、嚴禁條例"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寄禪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上三首見《八\n指頭陀詩集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "用白句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時師\n重修萬善寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上五首見《嚼\n梅唫藳》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此為《八指頭陀\n集》外稿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湛然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湛然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洛陽白馬寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北京法源寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諦閑上人曾作〈溥常法師玉照贊〉，云「其形如獅，其行可師」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "永嘉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "百辛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺舊名補陀，虔\n禮觀世音，亦如南海諸剎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師通《華嚴》，常以\n\n十玄六相課門徒，博辯宏通，在南北法筵中當為希有事也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師方創宗譜寺，\n內設報恩佛學院，即師所主持。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺舊名棲心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時有創修寺志之議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐大中十二年，\n分寧令任景求始捨宅為寺，至是千七十年矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君今應迹趙氏，或者古佛再來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明朝普陀觀音移此，名補陀寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本寺志乘正在\n集議起草"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "采泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺中有唐代石\n塔一，形如石鼓，旁列款識，云是補陀寺前身。師既重新佛殿，築龕奉塔，參拜甚勤。舍利事詳〈心鏡禪師傳〉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "意有未盡，附呈\n一首。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "永嘉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "碧琅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師能《華嚴》玄旨，\n其詮釋精到處，一時奉為圭臬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔饒德操祝髮後贈人詩，有「要做仲尼真弟子，須參達摩的兒孫」句。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺之初祖心鏡奐禪師，當剡寇肆掠，祖安坐入定不為動，盜因驚悸而退，嗣寺更名為棲\n心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師近方纂修寺志"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "百辛夙耽禪悅，\n而牢愁綺思又往往託諸吟咏，膾炙人口，不啻今之東坡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鎮海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "象山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "岐山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兆梅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是夕余因事未到"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "采泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "岐隱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菊庭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九一子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蕭山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別宥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺為初唐古剎，舊名補陀，主僧溥常長老精究《華嚴》，玄相重重，愧未能津逮也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長老因詢里居，因及永嘉真覺禪師化迹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溥公曾主金陵毗盧寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺有法喜社"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寥士所居與寺隣，修志之議，君\n倡之最力。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嘉善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "韓昌黎有至衡山晦冥默禱開雲故事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "往歲在池州辦\n鑛，日對九華山。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鎮海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐時寺名棲心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江寧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夢度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈豁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古靈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庚午秋，自老曾至文溪淨圓寺，為定華書記封關。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近聞自老已圓寂矣，因作此詩弔之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "江東迎春衖內，\n周文學之母，每夜五更，沿路敲木魚，為七塔寺募緣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周母敲木魚，其子持傘，隨後護之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伽藍神計十八\n位，今七塔寺當再添一位周婆。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憶余十四五歲，在江東親戚家，每至五夜，親聞周婆敲木魚聲。又曾至周宅取外科藥，適其隣\n人大爭鬧，而周文學呵呵大笑勸解之，此吾所目睹者。里人皆嘖嘖稱贊其賢孝，因其籍隸丐戶，無人為之呈請旌表。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃巖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "松渠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七塔寺即補陀寺，寺前有七塔，遂呼之以為名。其方丈溥常上人，湘籍，年逾古稀，居甬，與余大姪孫伯昻相友\n善，出《寺志》節略相示，徵文於余。余閱之，因知此寺即棲心寺也，爰作詩一章以應之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸暨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對面街名華嚴\n弄，余於此寺講是經三年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋大中祥符元年賜寺額曰崇壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今名七塔報恩寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺內附設報恩佛學院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國廿五年古歷十二月十五日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瑞庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靈橋改造鐵質，今始落成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳稱小普陀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光緒年間慈祖重興"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今年溥常和尚等發起創成志書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民國二十五年冬月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安置退居，公推起艸，載萬年部。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庾山退居寮，我先去住。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一月初八日，\n開光圓滿日退位，十七佛誕日，新方丈接事。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余在七塔寺夢見慈老人二次，另行寫出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三年冬，新戒六百有奇，及僧俗護法一千二三百多。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余與陳磬裁君擬修如意寮，未\n果。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開光餘款存庫房，候新方丈發心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄞縣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奉化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孟純"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報恩佛學院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "調寄沁園春"}
