{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廿九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卅一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卅二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卅三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卅四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《浙江統志．卷二百三十》引《成化四明郡志》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《宋高僧傳．三集．卷十二》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《佛祖統紀．卷十四》節錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "碑文亡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發心結緣者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心發心結緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "GA013n0012_p0176a09"}
{"id": null, "n": "a023001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_a023001", "type": "mod", "text": "第一阿若憍陳如尊者。劉璠敬修。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a012001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a012001", "type": "orig", "text": "慈運。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a023001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a023001", "type": "orig", "text": "弟一阿若憍陳如尊者。劉璠敬修。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a025001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a025001", "type": "orig", "text": "唐敕賜心鏡禪師真身舍利塔。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a026001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a026001", "type": "orig", "text": "碑文參見本志卷末補正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a099001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a099001", "type": "orig", "text": "原表請參閱底本 p.99-p.111。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a102001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a102001", "type": "orig", "text": "編按：為顧及法脈遞承的連接性，此下對應底本的頁碼乃權宜挪位。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a143001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a143001", "type": "orig", "text": "寶誌公。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a155001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a155001", "type": "orig", "text": "「頒」同「斑」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a168001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a168001", "type": "orig", "text": "參見圓瑛法師年譜 p.10。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a170001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a170001", "type": "orig", "text": "據卷末補正勘誤表，此「心」字衍。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a183001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a183001", "type": "orig", "text": "據卷末補正勘誤表，此「上」字衍。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a233001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a233001", "type": "orig", "text": "聞性道。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a235001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_a235001", "type": "orig", "text": "此為補正本志 p.27-p.28 開山祖塔碑文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "a002a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_a002a0101", "type": "add", "text": "此「版本說明」一文原為書本開頭無頁碼之插頁，今為標記架構上之需要移到此處，且以 pa002a 為虛擬頁欄碼。"}
